<div class="container">

<div class="about-section">
    
    <h2>About the Gallery</h2>
    <img src="https://images5.alphacoders.com/606/606284.jpg" alt="One Piece">
    
    <h2 class="text-center mb-4"> Welcome to the One Piece Character Gallery!</h2>
    <p> 
        This website was created to showcase some of the memorable characters from the world of One Piece, the gallery focuses on characters 
        from the Dressrosa arc and provides information about their roles and important characteristics.
    </p>

    <h4>What You Can Find</h4>
    
    <p> The gallery includes information about each character, including their role, abilities, species, and other important details from the anime. 
        You can browse through the characters on the home page and explore additional information about them through their detail pages. 
    </p>

    <h4>Character Details</h4> 
    <p>You can visit the detail page for Monkey D. Luffy to learn more about his journey, abilities, and goal of becoming the King of the Pirates.
       But on the home page you will be able to find the rest of the straw hat crew with their own details with more information about themselves. 
    </p>


</div>
